**Repair Note — ACE-DEV-FG-106: Wrong SECONDARY manifest selected (Q06F instead of Q06D)**

The agent selected manifest-06 (SCORE=61, TOKEN=Q06F) as the SECONDARY pick, but the correct result requires manifest-04 (SCORE=64, TOKEN=Q06D). Both pass REGION=WEST, ROUTE_KEY=DA0R06, SCORE≥61 filtering and are valid SECONDARY-role candidates. Under SECONDARY_MODE=FARTHEST_PIVOT_MIN_TOKEN (PIVOT=80), the agent correctly computed |61-80|=19 for manifest-06 and |64-80|=16 for manifest-04, but mistakenly interpreted "FARTHEST_PIVOT" as selecting the **largest** absolute distance — the correct behavior is smallest absolute distance (closest to pivot) first, then smallest TOKEN. With the correct interpretation, manifest-04 (|64-80|=16) wins over manifest-06 (|61-80|=19), yielding SUBJECT suffix `POL06-Q06H-Q06D-29` and attachments blob-04.txt + blob-08.txt. The fix: when resolving FARTHEST_PIVOT_MIN_TOKEN, sort by **ascending** |SCORE-PIVOT|, then ascending TOKEN; conversely, CLOSEST_PIVOT_MAX_TOKEN should use **descending** |SCORE-PIVOT| then descending TOKEN.